<title>UK: Frankfurter Hypo adds 1.5 bln marks to 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>Frankfurter Hypo adds 1.5 bln marks to 2004 bond.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, April 11 Reuter) - The following fungible bond was announced by joint lead managers Caisse des Depots et Consignations, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Frankfurter Hypothekenbank AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    16.JAN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    18.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  **	  REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+9 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED.</p>
</text>
